 
Fig : Entity Relationship Diagram of the JobPulse database showing primary keys, foreign keys, and cardinality among the normalized tables.
Parent Table	Child Table	Cardinality
companies	job_postings	1 : Many
companies	company_industries	1 : Many
job_postings	job_skills	1 : Many
salaries	None	Standalone


Note: The salaries table is maintained as a standalone analytical table because it originates from a separate salary survey dataset and does not share a reliable key with the LinkedIn job posting dataset.

